## AI Agent Reasoning

### Context
Issue #53 requires cin programs to run in Firefox extension pages where SharedArrayBuffer is unavailable.

### Decisions Made
- Preserve the SharedArrayBuffer path for Chromium live stdin.
- Add a discriminated buffered mode because synchronous WASI fd_read cannot await postMessage input.
- Validate UI-provided binary, VFS, and stdin fields at the worker boundary.
- Use cursor-based Uint8Array reads so buffered input is linear-time and reaches deterministic EOF.

### Trade-offs
- Firefox receives pre-supplied stdin rather than live prompt-by-prompt interaction.

